  "comment": "First screen - grub - press e Modify kernel line: add single between ro quiet and at the end of this line add init=/bin/bash Press F10 When the prompt is root@(none):/# you have to remount the / partition to have read-write access: mount / -rw -o remount Now you are ready to modify the root password: type passwd and change it!",
